<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - May 15.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - May 15.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire May 113.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk May 91.00/91.50 Jun 93.00/92.50 Jul 95.50 first half July 94.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jun 92.50</p>
<p>Southampton May 91.50 Jun 92.50</p>
<p>Avon range May 91.00 Jun 92.00 Jul 94.00</p>
<p>Herefordshire Jun 92.50 Jul 94.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Jun 92.75/93.00</p>
</text>
